    <string name="profile_5g_plus_help">Adds sub-6 display eligibility for n1/3/8/28/41/78/79, keeps existing bands, uses a 110 MHz NR-only threshold and removes the PCO display gate. The actual icon depends on carrier, bands and Android. This does not enable new modem capability or prove 5G-A, VoNR or faster data. Off restores saved original values; unsaved changes are cancelled. Review changes to apply.</string>
    <string name="profile_china_bars_help">Ultimate IMS profile: SS-RSRP thresholds −128, −118, −108 and −98 dBm. Keeps the existing NSA signal source and measurement selection. This changes displayed bars, not measured signal or speed, and is not a universal mainland carrier standard. Off restores saved original values; unsaved changes are cancelled. Other metrics remain editable in Configure.</string>
